# Layer boundaries

- `domain/` — pure electrical model; no pandas/geopandas/DB/DGS imports
- `input/` — formats and databases only
- `gis/` — CRS/geometry/spatial reconstruction only
- `dgs/` — schema-driven DGS; must not know GIS vendor brands
- Provider differences belong in YAML + adapters, not brand `if` branches
- Prefer extending the existing pipeline over writing DGS from raw tables
